<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's shows $11.1 mln net profit/96.</title>
<headline>Morocco's shows $11.1 mln net profit/96.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Banque Marocaine pour le Commerce et l'Industrie showed net profit of 102.5 million dirhams ($11.1 million) in 1996 from 61.2 million dirhams in 1995, a BMCI spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>BMCI, half owned by France's Banque Nationale de Paris Intercontinentale, registered a turnover of 1.0 billion dirhams in 1996 from 887.7 million dirhams in 1995.</p>
<p>One of Morocco's eight banks listed on the Casablanca stock exchange, BMCI was traded at 540 dirhams on Thursday.</p>
<p>($1= 9.2 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
